WEBVTT

00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:16,300
The last four nights, I have been having night sweats mostly around the head and neck, which is odd.

00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,300
Is there something I could do for the night sweats, any programs?

00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,300
So night sweats are a sign of something.

00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,300
So it's not necessarily what we want to do for.

00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:36,300
We want to figure out what you're having these night sweats, what it's caused by.

00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,300
No, a person can have night sweats.

00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:50,300
If they are on, if they have a cancer that is a hormone driven cancer, let's say they have ERPR positive cancer

00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:57,300
and we have them on an aromatase inhibitor supplement, or they're on an aromatase inhibitor medication.

00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:04,300
That can certainly give you night sweats because you're basically putting yourself into an estrogen deprivation

00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:07,300
and that's the goal of those things.

00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:12,300
And you are basically getting these hot flash type things.

00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:17,300
If you don't have that type of cancer and we don't have you on that type of product,

00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:21,300
then there's other reasons why a person gets night sweats.

00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:29,300
A person with lymphoma and get night sweats because lymphoma can affect your hormone balance

00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:32,300
and you can get night sweats from the lymphoma.

00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:37,300
So we should really have a discussion with the person who wrote this.

00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:44,300
If you want to call and talk and we should make an appointment, there aren't any specific right programs for night sweats.

00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:46,300
You deal with it.

00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:55,300
You use the right treatment or nutritional treatment or medication or whatever based upon the cause of it.

00:01:55,300 --> 00:02:00,300
So we'd be looking at really those two things.

00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:09,300
Night sweats are either cause from a cancer like a lymphoma or from a hormone disruption

00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:18,300
like somebody going through benapause or somebody going through a forced reduction in estrogen

00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:22,300
by taking some sort of aromatase inhibitor product.

